  <name>Claude</name>
  <summary>Desktop application for Claude.ai</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Claude Desktop is the Linux desktop client for Claude, the AI assistant built by Anthropic. This is an unofficial Flatpak package of the official release.
    </p>
    <p>The app includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Chat with Claude, including projects and artifacts</li>
      <li>Model Context Protocol (MCP) server support</li>
      <li>Claude Code sessions and the Cowork local sandbox</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The sandbox is permissive: the app can read your home folder and run commands on the host through flatpak-spawn. See the project page for details and known limitations.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.anthropic.Claude.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://claude.ai</url>
  <url type="help">https://support.anthropic.com</url>
